Package: OHLviz
Type: Package
Title: Visualize Ontario Hockey League Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Noah", "Cornish",
      email = "noahcornish7@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
  )
Description: Create consistent, publication-quality visualizations of
    Ontario Hockey League data using 'ggplot2'. Provides chart themes
    and plotting functions for player scoring, team scoring, and
    goaltender performance. Functions accept data frames, allowing
    data retrieval and analysis to remain separate from visualization.
